Competitors (insights & trends): {{ $('Loop Tranches').item.json.competitorsWhy }} & {{ $('Loop Tranches').item.json.competitorsTrends }}
Market Research: {{ $('Loop Tranches').item.json.marketSummary }}
Trend Research: {{ $('Loop Tranches').item.json.trendNotes }}
Hashtags: {{ $('Loop Tranches').item.json.trendHashtags }}
Business Context: {{ $('Loop Tranches').item.json['bussines context'] }}

RULES
- Generate exactly 10 post ideas, one for each theme/day in Themes10 (preserve all original date/day/time data).
- Ensure post concepts demonstrate variety, depth, and niche relevance consistent with {{ $('Loop Tranches').item.json['bussines context'] }}.
- If platform data differs, specify unique styles or focuses per platform (e.g., Instagram visual storytelling vs Facebook authority post).
- Each idea must include:
  • Post name (≤ 6 words)
  • VisualConcept (1–2 sentences)
  • Hook (1 sentence)
  • CTA (imperative tone)
  • OverlayText (≤ 12 words)
  • Notes (1 concise line)
- Align each VisualConcept closely with the provided theme’s context and tone.
- Include business-related hashtags in Notes or CTA if contextually relevant.

# OUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON)
